4c:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"unsafe"}]," is rare: a few dozen blocks in the whole tree, mostly FFI, a few\nmeasured optimizations, and environment-variable writes in tests. Most carry\na ",["$","code",null,{"children":"// SAFETY:"}]," comment, and a new one without a justification will be asked\nfor one."]}]
